          "heading": "Six Nations and Sanzaar bid to scrap 2030 relegation with Fiji bottom",
          "body": "The fight over the Nations Championship's relegation mechanism remains unsettled. Last week the Guardian reported that the Six Nations and Sanzaar face a fresh battle with World Rugby in their bid to remove the drop from the competition, with the threat due to arrive in 2030. No agreement on that structure has yet been reported. Fiji go into this weekend's Round 6 trip to Italy in Udine 12th of 12, without a win in five and with a points difference of -161."
