          "heading": "Asher Opoku-Fordjour pays tribute to single mum Rebecca on England podcast",
          "body": "England and Sale Sharks prop Asher Opoku-Fordjour, 22, has told the England Rugby Podcast how his mum, Rebecca, raised him and his three brothers alone while working to provide for them. \"We didn't realise how tough it was on her until you look back,\" he said. A footballer as a boy, he took up rugby only at 10, when his dad, having watched a Six Nations game, took him to the local rugby club. England, fresh from beating Japan 78-15, face New Zealand on Saturday."
