          "kicker": "Selection call",
          "heading": "Matthieu Jalibert takes fly-half role in Bleus training, set to face Argentina",
          "body": "Rugbyrama reports one firm answer from Tuesday's first full session at Marcoussis: Jalibert will run the game against the Pumas at the Stade de France on Saturday. That gives France a more conventional half-back pairing after captain Antoine Dupont's improvised stint in the No. 10 jersey against South Africa. Outside back Aaron Grandidier-Nkanang was spared, his Pau teammate Grégoire Arfeuil stepping in, with the rest of the backline almost unchanged. France must win to be certain of a place in the Nations Championship final in London."
