          "heading": "Simon Easterby questions spirit of Rassie Erasmus' late Springbok front-row switches",
          "body": "Ireland assistant coach Simon Easterby is wary of more last-minute Springbok selection changes before Saturday's Nations Championship test at the Aviva Stadium. Springboks head coach Rassie Erasmus moved Jan-Hendrik Wessels, Gerhard Steenekamp and Thomas du Toit from the bench into his starting front row shortly before kick-off against France. Erasmus has hinted he could do so again depending on the team Ireland pick. Easterby said: \"I'm not saying it's not in the spirit of the game, but maybe it's not in the spirit of the game.\""
