          "heading": "Italy's Argentina defeat draws 314,483 viewers, up on South Africa test",
          "body": "Last Saturday's 14-19 defeat to Argentina in Genoa drew 314,483 Italian viewers. Free-to-air TV8 carried the bulk with 208,967, while 89,931 more watched the Sky Sport Uno simulcast and 15,585 tuned in on Sky Sport Arena. That beat the 294,345 who watched the 7-66 loss to South Africa a week earlier, and dwarfed the 60,883 Sky audience for Wales' win over New Zealand. Saturday's Fiji test in Udine is again on TV8, Sky Sport Arena and NOWtv."
