          "kicker": "Injury blow",
          "heading": "Scotland lose captain Sione Tuipulotu and three others for Japan finale",
          "body": "Sunday's 15-12 win over Australia cost Scotland three more: Toulon scrum-half Ben White (knee), Toshiba Brave Lupus No. 8 Jack Dempsey (foot) and Glasgow lock Scott Cummings (leg), while Tuipulotu had pulled out late with a knee injury. Edinburgh forwards Grant Gilchrist and Magnus Bradbury and Leicester Tigers lock Cam Henderson join head coach Gregor Townsend's squad for Saturday's game against Japan at Murrayfield. Scrum coach Pieter de Villiers called Tuipulotu a \"fantastic captain\" but praised Glasgow team-mate Rory Darge, who led the side against the Wallabies, for stepping up."
