          "body": "Glasgow centre Tuipulotu, a late withdrawal from Sunday's win over Australia with a knee problem, misses Saturday's Nations Championship group finale against the Brave Blossoms at Murrayfield. Toulon scrum-half Ben White (knee), Toshiba Brave Lupus No. 8 Jack Dempsey (foot) and Glasgow lock Scott Cummings (leg) were all hurt in that game. Rory Darge, who led Scotland on Sunday, keeps the captaincy; head coach Gregor Townsend has called up Grant Gilchrist, Magnus Bradbury and Cam Henderson, and uncapped Glasgow back Josh McKay could debut."
